[h]oardDB> show databases
DATABASES
---
(no databases yet — create one with 'create database <name>')
[h]oardDB> create database app
OK  created database app (replication factor 1, this node's default)
Next: use app
Then: create bucket <name> { Name string, Purchases fifoStore }   (declare every field)
[h]oardDB> create database shop { replication_factor: 1 }
OK  created database shop (replication factor 1)
Next: use shop
Then: create bucket <name> { Name string, Purchases fifoStore }   (declare every field)
[h]oardDB> show databases
DATABASES
---
NAME  ID                REPLICATION
app   <BUCKET-ID.....>  rf 1
shop  <BUCKET-ID.....>  rf 1
[h]oardDB> show databases limit 1
DATABASES
---
NAME  ID                REPLICATION
app   <BUCKET-ID.....>  rf 1
more: show databases limit 1 cursor 617070
[h]oardDB> use app
Switched to database 'app'
[h]oardDB [app]> show buckets
BUCKETS in app
---
(no buckets yet — create one with 'create bucket <name> in app { Name string }')
[h]oardDB [app]> describe database app
DATABASE app
---
Id:                 <BUCKET-ID.....>
Replication factor: 1
Storage:            disk
Buckets:            0
